{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>בעל טעם</b> — from its sense [of] טעמו וראו, and here רחום בעל טעם — counsel." "<b>כנמא</b> — as it is said, and this is the statement of the scribe, and the arrangement of the book [is] its sense [is] as it is said: thus was the letter that the aforementioned ones sent. Or כנמא [means] as the sense [requires] now."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:50.546890991Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}